WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.357 --> 00:00:15.559
Brad: How are we going to get to the rainbow?

2
00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:20.386
Tina: It's high above the mountain, and the mountain is so far away.

3
00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:25.179
Danny: We can get there the same way that we got down from the mountain.

4
00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:30.158
Brad: That's right. We'll use the hot air balloon.

5
00:00:30.159 --> 00:00:33.453
Danny: So this . . . this is it.

6
00:00:33.454 --> 00:00:37.275
We . . . have to say . . . good-bye.

7
00:00:37.276 --> 00:00:39.891
Hopian: It's okay, Danny.

8
00:00:39.892 --> 00:00:42.875
Danny: I'll never forget you.

9
00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:48.941
Hopian: I'll never forget you.

10
00:00:48.942 --> 00:00:52.065
All: Bye-bye!

11
00:00:52.066 --> 00:00:54.835
Danny: It's hard to believe we're going home.

12
00:00:54.836 --> 00:00:58.917
Brad: This was the most amazing adventure.

13
00:00:58.918 --> 00:01:07.800
Tina: I'm going to miss all the excitement.

14
00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.376
Danny: Oh my gosh!

15
00:01:09.377 --> 00:01:14.083
Do you guys see that?

16
00:01:14.084 --> 00:01:16.359
Tina: It looks like Hopian was right.

17
00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.560
They won't forget us.

18
00:01:18.561 --> 00:01:20.746
Brad: Let's keep walking, guys.

19
00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:27.139
We have a long way to go.

20
00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:39.054
Tina: Ready? Up we go.

21
00:01:39.055 --> 00:01:42.789
Danny: The land is so beautiful from up here.

22
00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:45.119
Tina: That's where we fought Tristay.

23
00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:50.784
It's the most beautiful place of all!

24
00:01:50.785 --> 00:01:56.739
Brad: It was always a magical place, remember.

25
00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:02.520
Tina: There's the rainbow.

26
00:02:02.521 --> 00:02:04.707
Danny: We're almost there.

27
00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:07.411
Brad: Now what?

28
00:02:07.412 --> 00:02:15.916
Danny: We jump!

29
00:02:15.917 --> 00:02:17.550
Danny: Ow!

30
00:02:17.551 --> 00:02:19.257
Brad: That hurt.

31
00:02:19.258 --> 00:02:22.372
Tina: Where are we?

32
00:02:22.373 --> 00:02:29.608
Danny: We're in the bushes near the schoolyard!

33
00:02:29.609 --> 00:02:31.972
Tina: It looks like a fire drill.

34
00:02:31.973 --> 00:02:35.771
Brad: Thank goodness! No one will know that we've been gone.

35
00:02:35.772 --> 00:02:38.130
Danny: They will if they see us here.

36
00:02:38.131 --> 00:02:46.639
Tina: Quick, let's join a line.

37
00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.947
Tina: I think no one noticed.

38
00:02:48.948 --> 00:02:51.699
Danny: Our adventures are finally over.

39
00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:55.928
Brad: Shh. Keep quiet.

40
00:02:55.929 --> 00:03:00.362
Dave: Well, well, well. Look who's here!

41
00:03:00.363 --> 00:03:05.149
Chuck: It's the clay boy and his two loser friends!

42
00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:07.314
Dave: Isn't that sweet!

43
00:03:07.315 --> 00:03:11.911
The boyfriend and the girlfriend are together!

44
00:03:11.912 --> 00:03:20.054
Chuck: Are you going to ask your girlfriend to protect you again?

45
00:03:20.055 --> 00:03:22.741
Danny: I think it's time to use the clay.

46
00:03:22.742 --> 00:03:25.674
Brad: I don't think it'll be magical here, Danny.

47
00:03:25.675 --> 00:03:39.715
Danny: Trust me. These bullies aren't going to bother us anymore.

48
00:03:39.716 --> 00:03:43.103
Brad: Now that's using your imagination.

49
00:03:43.104 --> 00:03:49.702
Tina: That's perfect!

50
00:03:49.703 --> 00:03:56.417
Danny: I can't hear you!
